SUMMARY:The Art of Visible Mending: Mend & Patch
DESCRIPTION:Learn the basics of clothing repair while adding creative flair to well-loved garments. This introductory workshop covers hand-sewing techniques\, material selection\, and several decorative patching styles for non-stretch woven fabrics. \nIn this workshop you’ll:\n• Choose materials for functional\, beautiful repairs\n• Practice basic hand-stitching techniques\n• Sew multiple styles of decorative patches \nBring a damaged garment to mend\, or use provided samples. Materials included; no experience required.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/the-art-of-visible-mending-mend-patch/
LOCATION:Gather Sebastopol\, 122 N. Main Street\, Sebastopol\, 95472
CATEGORIES:Skill-Building Workshop
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/VisibleMending-Patching-2.png
END:VEVENT
