DESCRIPTION:Join us at Produce Exchange/Donation events to trade surplus items from your garden for something you don’t have. You may also bring produce that you have gleaned (with permission of course) from a neighbor’s yard. Master Food Preservers will be on hand to answer questions and to provide recipes and samples during tabling. Surplus produce will be donated.
