SUMMARY:The Art of Floral Arranging with California Sister
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Gather Sebastopol for a hands-on floral design workshop with Nichole Skalski\, artist\, floral designer\, and owner of Sonoma County studio California Sister. Working with seasonal blooms\, you’ll explore the foundations of floral arranging while learning how color\, texture\, form\, and proportion come together to create a balanced\, expressive arrangement. \nIn this workshop\, you’ll:\n• Learn practical techniques for working with color\, shape\, and texture\n• Explore balance\, proportion\, and composition in floral design\n• Build confidence developing arrangements in your own personal style\n• Create a seasonal floral arrangement to take home \nAll flowers\, tools\, and materials are included. No prior floral design experience required.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/the-art-of-floral-arranging-with-california-sister/
LOCATION:Gather Sebastopol\, 122 N. Main Street\, Sebastopol\, 95472
CATEGORIES:Skill-Building Workshop
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/intuitive-floral.png
END:VEVENT
