SUMMARY:EPH Emergency Preparedness Workshop for Seniors
DESCRIPTION:Come join a free 2-part emergency preparedness workshop\, tailored to older adults\, put on by Emergency Prep Help (EPH). Participants learn about: making a personalized emergency plan\, fire and evacuation safety\, emergency go-bags\, earthquake readiness\, supplies to keep at home\, car preparations\, securing important documents\, pet safety in evacuation\, 2-1-1 resources\, and more. \n* Featuring expert speakers\, FREE go-bags\, and other incentives! * (flyer attached) \nPart 1: 9/13/26\, 2:00 – 4:00\nPart 2: 9/27/26\, 2:00 – 4:00\nLocation: Sebastopol Community Cultural Center \nIt’s a 2-part workshop. Attendees come to both sessions for the full curriculum.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/eph-emergency-preparedness-workshop-for-seniors/2026-09-13/
LOCATION:390 Morris St\, Sebastopol\, CA 95472
CATEGORIES:Older adults generally, 60+
